I can recommend you to try KEMI hair trimmer. It was the last model in series KEMI series and was introduced to markets back in 2013. With this model, they added new accessories and features that were not available in previous models, like combs and additional power. This model was also the first in series KEMI to offer a 2 year warranty.
KEMI trimmers are a bit more expensive than Andis, DeWalt and Phillips hair trimmers, however, they come with more features and more options to choose from. To sum up, this article has reviewed the four most popular hair trimmers on the market and it is very hard to recommend us a specific product.
